:: Arrive in Pontchartrain Beach {"position":"575,350","size":"200,200"}
You emerge from the jungle into ''Pontchartrain Beach'', a small town built out of the ruins of an abandoned water park. You are initially in the central market area, at the "shore" of the ''deactivated wave pool''.

The market has a ''sparse crowd'' of (seeming) humans and (seeming) animals.
<<if $pbFigureSeen isnot true  >>
There is a ''mysterious figure'' in the crowd.
<<endif>>

----

